| Learning rewards ({{F:learnRewardList}}) | Children who answer well hardly notice the reward; or children who answer badly cannot keep up at all | Change the block values; keep one value per block |
| Starting credits (150) | Children want a fourth astronaut at once; or wave 1 is trivial | 150 to 200 |
